OL,3,GNEWSAHome of Shakespeare's daughter
OL,4,Aadded to at-risk list
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe former home of William
OL,7,FShakespeare's daughter and a Grade
OL,8,FI-listed 16th Century hotel are among
OL,9,Fthe sites to be added to Historic
OL,10,FEngland's Heritage at Risk Register.
OL,12,FHall's Croft in Stratford-upon-Avon and
OL,13,FThe Lion Hotel, a historic coaching inn
OL,14,Fin Shrewsbury, have been added to the
OL,15,Flist amid concerns over their
OL,16,Fcondition.
OL,18,FThe annual register highlights
OL,19,FEngland's most vulnerable heritage
OL,20,Fassets and the support needed to
OL,21,Fprotect them.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
