OL,3,GNEWSAHome of Shakespeare's daughter
OL,4,Aadded to at-risk list
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis year, 58 sites across the whole of
OL,7,Fthe Midlands have been added while 13
OL,8,Fsites have been removed after
OL,9,Fundergoing conservation work. In the
OL,10,FWest Midlands region, 28 have been
OL,11,Fadded and five removed.
